      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_d2da6a5c",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: aim_wait_fire; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in a tactical or combat setting, holding a firearm and aiming directly at the viewer, with the text 'aim. wait. fire.' overlaid. The scene is intense and focused, suggesting a metaphorical or literal call to action. The overall intent is to convey a message of preparation, patience, and decisive action — often used to encourage strategic thinking or to signal readiness to act in a high-stakes situation. There is no evidence of toxicity, harmful content, or disparaging stereotypes present in the image. The meme is not targeted at any specific group or community and does not contain abusive, cyberbullying, hateful, misogynistic, or propagandistic elements. The intent is purely motivational or instructional, using the visual of a focused, armed individual to reinforce the textual message of timing and precision in action.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_266bea14"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
