      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_60e65108",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "person",
      "label": "General Audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for a broad, general audience with no specific demographic or community targeting. The visual of a man in a tactical setting and the text 'aim. wait. fire.' are universally understood as motivational or instructional, applicable to contexts like business, sports, military strategy, or personal development. The image does not contain any cultural, racial, gendered, or community-specific markers that would indicate targeting a particular group. The intent is to convey a universal message of preparation, patience, and decisive action, making it accessible to anyone who can interpret the metaphorical or literal meaning of the phrase.",
